ex:SustainabilityParticipation_KnowledgeUnderstanding3 a ex:KnowledgeUnderstanding ;
    rdfs:label "생태시민의 의미와 역할"@ko .

ex:SustainabilityParticipation_ProcessSkill1 a ex:ProcessSkill ;
    rdfs:label "지속가능성의 복합적 의미 탐색하기"@ko .

ex:SustainabilityParticipation_ProcessSkill2 a ex:ProcessSkill ;
    rdfs:label "지속가능한 미래를 꿈꾸고 상호 소통하기"@ko .

